<section>
  <h2 id="limits">What the data is not</h2>
  <p>
    The files are not a blocklist to apply unreviewed: many indicators are
    shared infrastructure or belong to people whose identities were stolen. See
    <a href="/guidance/#employers">If you find a match</a> first.
  </p>
</section>
